WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.034
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:03.169
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.304
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:05.804
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:09.142
The 64th annual Grammy Awards
were held last night,

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:12.311
and featured a pre-recorded
video from Ukrainian president

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:13.813
Volodomyr Zelenskyy.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.149
And I gotta say,
as a 48-year-old man,

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.483
I was just happy to see

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:19.652
someone at the Grammys
whose name I knew.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.887
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.588
Oh! Oh!

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:26.058
New York Mayor Eric Adams
on Saturday

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:28.728
visited the White House,
and that is the closest

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.531
any New York mayor has gotten
to the White House.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.899
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:36.035
-President Biden is set to host
former President Obama

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:38.538
tomorrow at the White House,
and you know Joe is excited.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.740
I'll bet he's turning the house
upside down right now

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.909
looking for the other
controller.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.577
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:47.913
The House on Friday passed
a bill to legalize marijuana,

00:00:47.913 --> 00:00:49.582
largely along party lines.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.584
Then Don Jr. got excited

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.821
because he thought they had
legalized party lines.

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:57.823
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:00.660
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki is reportedly planning

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.161
to leave the Biden
administration

00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:03.495
in the next several weeks

00:01:03.495 --> 00:01:06.232
to host a show on NBC's
streaming platform, Peacock.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:07.232
Oh, God.

00:01:07.232 --> 00:01:08.568
Can I please be there

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:11.904
when you teach Joe
how to download Peacock?

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:13.907
"I need a Roku?

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:16.743
Isn't that one of those
Japanese poems?"

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.579
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.914
The media company BuzzFeed
over the weekend

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:23.416
shut down its news app.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.251
There were many reasons
for the move,

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:27.754
and number seven will shock you!

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.756
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:32.258
The Navy announced on Friday
it will name a ship

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.927
after the late Supreme Court
Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg.

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:36.095
And this is cool --

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:38.598
Senor Frog's is naming
their 64-ounce margarita

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.266
"The Kavanaugh."

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.602
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.571
President Biden said last week
he believes

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:46.239
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.908
has placed some of his top
advisers under house arrest.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.743
Said Putin's oligarch advisers,

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.912
"Oh, no, not house arrest."

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:54.580
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.083
And finally, Apple is reportedly
set to announce

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.118
a new policy to deter thieves

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:00.453
from trying to steal --

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:02.788
excuse me, trying to sell
stolen iPhones.

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:05.458
They're gonna slap
an Android sticker on it.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.526
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:07.894
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

